<!--
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  MIRAI DESIGN SYSTEM — COLOR TOKENS  v1.0
  Premium Anime Social Platform · Dark + Cinematic + Modern + Elegant
  ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  RULES
  1. Layouts NEVER hardcode hex again — always reference a token.
  2. Surfaces are opaque dark neutrals (NOT white-alpha glass):
     Background #0B0D10 → Surface #11151A → Card #151A20 → Elevated #1A2028
  3. One accent pair only: Primary #00A3FF (action/trust) and
     Secondary #7C4DFF (identity/premium). Semantic colors carry state.
  4. White-alpha values are reserved EXCLUSIVELY for scrims/overlays
     on top of imagery — never for component surfaces.
  ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  MIGRATION MAP (old scattered hex → new token)
    #0A0C10 #121212 #1E1E1E #1A1A1A      → mirai_bg / mirai_surface_*
    #1AFFFFFF #33FFFFFF (glass cards)    → mirai_card + mirai_border
    #00FF87 #0DF20D #0DF233 #0CC84F
    #27DA64 #4CAF50 (6 different greens) → mirai_success
    #FAA751 #F59E0B                      → mirai_rating / mirai_warning
    #EF4444 #FF5252 #D32F2F              → mirai_error
    #9CA3AF #94A3B8 #A0A0A0 #8E8E93
    #7B83A0 #9E9E9E #888888 #757575 …    → mirai_text_secondary/_tertiary
    #E0E0E0 #E2E8F0 #C1C6D6 #D1D5DB      → mirai_text_primary
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
-->
